An array of the new data points, one per feed. Feeds that don't exist in the group yet are created automatically. Feeds your key can't write to are skipped without an error. Each feed counts as one action against your data rate. If the whole request doesn't fit in your remaining rate, nothing is saved and a `429` is returned.


