created_at | string | false | Timestamp applied to every data point.
location | object | false | `{ lat: number, lon: number, ele: number }` applied to every data point.

Example body: `{ "feeds": [ { "key": "temperature", "value": "22.5" } ], "created_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "location": { "lat": 40.7, "lon": -74.0, "ele": 10 } }`



